{
  "_comment": [
    "Decides which zigbee-OTA images (manufacturerCode 4107, matched on imageType) go into which driver.",
    "Resolution per driver: an entry in \"drivers\" wins; otherwise the first matching rule in \"rules\" (top to bottom).",
    "A rule matches when its \"pattern\" (regex) matches the driver id and its \"template\" (regex) matches one of the driver $extends templates; omitted fields always match.",
    "imageTypes may be numbers or hex strings. An empty list means: no firmware for this driver.",
    "Only the newest file per imageType is included unless the entry sets \"latestOnly\": false.",
    "Confirmed via the deCONZ OTA plugin table (github.com/dresden-elektronik/deconz-ota-plugin): 0x0109 dimmer v1, 0x010D motion sensor, 0x0115/0x011A smart plug, 0x0116 smart button, 0x0119 dimmer 2021, 0x011B motion sensor 2022, 0x011C wall switch module, 0x011F Ensis, 0x0121 tap dial. Everything else is a best guess from the Hue hardware generation. Wrong entries are harmless (Homey matches manufacturerCode + imageType) but cost app size.",
    "When the script reports a new imageType, add it to \"imageTypes\" and to a rule."
  ],
  "imageTypes": {
